# Normalise line endings.
#
# Without this, every file checked out on Windows comes back CRLF and shows as
# fully modified in `git status` (616 insertions / 616 deletions across 7 files
# on 2026-08-15) even when nothing changed, which buries real diffs.
#
# Apply once, as its own commit:
#   git add --renormalize .
#   git commit -m "chore: normalise line endings to LF"

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must never be normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
